\f3\i \cf5 \cb6 fuel.shift(-1)
\f0\i0 \cf2 \cb12  as the realised price target. This embeds mild look-ahead in the rolling MSFE. The Energy+AR model does NOT use behavioural features and is leakage-free. Behavioural features are used only in Energy+Behavioural+AR and Full, where an extra lag(1) was applied at merge time as a partial mitigation."\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \
