\cf2 \cb3 24. Final Project Summary\cb1 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa140\partightenfactor0
\ls51\ilvl0\cf2 \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
What Was Built: Lambda BI Ltd developed an analytical crisis prediction platform that unifies UK macroeconomic data cleaning, an econometric Vector Autoregression (VAR) suite with historical crisis stress quantification, an evolutionary Agent-Based Model (ABM) simulating dual-heuristic consumer expectations, an out-of-sample machine learning forecasting benchmark (Ridge, ElasticNet, HistGradientBoosting, XGBoost, LSTM), and an 8-page Streamlit interactive dashboard.\cb1 \
\ls51\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
What Was Tested: 48 model-feature-target specifications were rigorously evaluated out-of-sample on 52 monthly observations from January 2021 to April 2025 across two targets (GVA growth and Retail Sales growth) and four feature hierarchies (\cf5 \cb6 AR-only\cf2 \cb3 , \cf5 \cb6 Energy+AR\cf2 \cb3 , \cf5 \cb6 Energy+Behavioural+AR\cf2 \cb3 , and \cf5 \cb6 Full\cf2 \cb3 ).\cb1 \
\ls51\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
What Was Found:\cb1 \
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\sa140\partightenfactor0
\ls51\ilvl1\cf2 \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
For GVA growth, regularised linear models (Ridge and ElasticNet) were the top performers, with Ridge achieving the best overall test RMSE of 3.963 under the Full feature set (        \
\ls51\ilvl1\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
      , Directional Accuracy = 84.6%).\cb1 \
\ls51\ilvl1\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Gradient-boosted decision trees (HistGB and XGBoost) suffered from substantial out-of-sample overfitting on GVA (RMSE         \
\ls51\ilvl1\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
      ).\cb1 \
\ls51\ilvl1\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	5	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Retail Sales volume growth was essentially unforecastable during the 2021\'962025 period across all models (all         \
\ls51\ilvl1\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	6	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
      , top RMSE = 2.137 by Ridge under Energy+AR).\cb1 \
\ls51\ilvl1\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	7	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Energy variables yielded modest error reductions (+1.3% to +1.6%) for linear models on GVA, but degraded non-linear models.\cb1 \
\ls51\ilvl1\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	8	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
The inclusion of ABM behavioural features produced 0.0% measured improvement in test RMSE over the Energy+AR specification.\cb1 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa140\partightenfactor0
\ls51\ilvl0\cf2 \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
What the Application Demonstrates: The Streamlit dashboard allows both technical econometricians and executive stakeholders to visually inspect historical crisis stress, examine empirical VAR impulse response dynamics, interactively simulate policy and price shock counterfactuals, and review ML forecast benchmarks in a unified environment.\cb1 \
